$WEATHER DATA : Greenhouse, Wageningen University, The Netherlands
!
! SRAD, TMAX, TMIN digitized 2026-08-04 from Heinen 1994 (Rapport 1, exp 6705)
! Figure 3.1 "Mean daily temperatures inside/outside the greenhouse and daily
! radiation sum" (T inside/outside axis, radiation kJ/cm2 axis), read manually
! off the chart image, +/- ~0.5-1 C for temperature and +/- ~0.1-0.2 kJ/cm2 for
! radiation (worse on the sharpest spikes: day 3, 11, 23-26, 30-34). Radiation
! converted kJ/cm2 -> MJ/m2 (DSSAT SRAD unit) via x10. TMAX/TMIN are NOT directly
! read off the figure -- the figure gives only ONE inside-temperature value per
! day (explicitly a daily average per Heinen sec 2.1: "monitored every two hours
! and daily averages were computed"). TMAX/TMIN estimated as T_inside +/- 2.5 C,
! using half of the reported day(15C)/night(10C) greenhouse setpoint differential
! (Heinen sec 2.1) as the assumed diurnal swing -- this is an ASSUMPTION, not a
! digitized value. Days 1991147-154 (pre-transplant) and 1991205-208 (post-
! harvest) have no figure coverage; day1 and day50 values are carried backward/
! forward respectively for those buffer days. DEWP/WIND/RAIN unchanged from the
! prior placeholder file (no new source found for these).
! SRAD +2.0 MJ/m2/day adjustment (added 2026-08-04) was REVERTED 2026-08-12
! (user instruction). SRAD values now equal the Fig 3.1 digitized values with
! no offset. New peak (day 34) = 27.0 MJ/m2/day.
!
@ INSI      LAT     LONG  ELEV   TAV   AMP REFHT WNDHT
  WAGA  51.970    5.670    12  16.3   4.0   2.0   2.0
